Each time you apply Jinx to an enemy, you have a [35%, 47%, 55%, 60%, 64% (TL1-5)] chance to siphon some of their luck for yourself for 5 turns. This stacks up to 10 times, increasing saves and defense by [1.00, 2.00, 2.00, 3.00, 3.00 (TL1-5)] and critical strike chance by [1.00%, 1.00%, 1.50%, 1.50%, 2.00% (TL1-5)].

If you know Preordain, stacks beyond 6 also grant a [2%, 3%, 3%, 4%, 4% (TL1-5)] chance for you to entirely avoid damage taken.
